<!doctype lake><title>教案05-控制流</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1 data-lake-id="Hmpqy" id="Hmpqy"><span data-lake-id="u925b2433" id="u925b2433">1.控制流</span></h1><p data-lake-id="d47314c18e688e384a8628e38e979e2f" id="d47314c18e688e384a8628e38e979e2f"><span data-lake-id="uab90774c" id="uab90774c" class="lake-fontsize-12">程序语言中的控制流语句用于控制各计算操作执行的</span><span data-lake-id="u664e1422" id="u664e1422" class="lake-fontsize-12">次序</span><span data-lake-id="ub776ff06" id="ub776ff06" class="lake-fontsize-12">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="3c94f5ff748495cb8fba1302561d3c36" id="3c94f5ff748495cb8fba1302561d3c36"><span data-lake-id="u58ee27fe" id="u58ee27fe" class="lake-fontsize-12">根据对语句执行顺序的影响，C语言的其余语句大多属 于以下3大类。</span></p><ul list="u31cefabd"><li fid="ue524f3ff" data-lake-id="ue6583993" id="ue6583993"><span data-lake-id="u05346103" id="u05346103" class="lake-fontsize-12">选择语句 （selection statement）。if 语句和switch 语句 允许程序在一组可选项中选择一条特定的执行路径。</span></li><li fid="ue524f3ff" data-lake-id="u045db5f2" id="u045db5f2"><span data-lake-id="ue19b8347" id="ue19b8347" class="lake-fontsize-12">循环语句 （iteration statement）。while 语句、do 语句和 for 语句支持重复（循环）操作。</span></li><li fid="ue524f3ff" data-lake-id="u9a4cfb86" id="u9a4cfb86"><span data-lake-id="u5d55c18a" id="u5d55c18a" class="lake-fontsize-12">跳转语句 （jump statement）。break 语句、continue 语句 和goto 语句导致无条件地跳转到程序中的某个位置。（return 语句也属于此类。）</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="RtdPN" id="RtdPN"><span data-lake-id="ub9eb5f74" id="ub9eb5f74">2.选择语句</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id="jGhTm" id="jGhTm"><span data-lake-id="uc14f3116" id="uc14f3116">2.1 if</span></h2><p data-lake-id="aa04e138a39fa02d9535180c61197676" id="aa04e138a39fa02d9535180c61197676"><span data-lake-id="u6756de69" id="u6756de69" class="lake-fontsize-12">if 语句：表达一种 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3a865564" id="u3a865564" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果-则 </span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf7701b13" id="uf7701b13" class="lake-fontsize-12">的条件执行关系</span></p><p data-lake-id="5a4c066e2a171997b29d849ecabcf436" id="5a4c066e2a171997b29d849ecabcf436"><span data-lake-id="u6d9b12c5" id="u6d9b12c5" class="lake-fontsize-12">if-else 语句：表达一种 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uef01ece8" id="uef01ece8" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果-否则 </span></strong><span data-lake-id="u17823792" id="u17823792" class="lake-fontsize-12">的</span><span data-lake-id="ucbe298f4" id="ucbe298f4" class="lake-fontsize-12">互斥</span><span data-lake-id="u0f8fa19f" id="u0f8fa19f" class="lake-fontsize-12">分支关系</span></p><p data-lake-id="e494d8082ce691d1cae1aeb4b1de3301" id="e494d8082ce691d1cae1aeb4b1de3301"><em><span data-lake-id="ucafd1dc2" id="ucafd1dc2" class="lake-fontsize-12"> if 语句</span></em></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if(a%252%20%3D%3D%200)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22a%E6%98%AF%E5%81%B6%E6%95%B0%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CkFVe%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="8d5c4df7dbe034cc261361b2229d6bbf" id="8d5c4df7dbe034cc261361b2229d6bbf"><em><span data-lake-id="u808843e9" id="u808843e9" class="lake-fontsize-12"> if-else 语句</span></em></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if(a%252%20%3D%3D%200)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22a%E6%98%AF%E5%81%B6%E6%95%B0%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnelse%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22a%E6%98%AF%E5%A5%87%E6%95%B0%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TgbFj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="b380ad5171c1ca8ed92179e905da8958" id="b380ad5171c1ca8ed92179e905da8958"><span data-lake-id="u6912acc5" id="u6912acc5" class="lake-fontsize-12">if 语句可以单独使用，else 语句不可以，else 语句必须跟if语句配套使用；</span><span data-lake-id="u75610dd8" id="u75610dd8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">如果只有一条执行语句，不加{}也可</span></p><p data-lake-id="16254c1c75fa3b8fae53ab4dfb3a3070" id="16254c1c75fa3b8fae53ab4dfb3a3070"><span data-lake-id="u1365a986" id="u1365a986" class="lake-fontsize-12">不管是 if 语句还是 else 语句，代码块都必须使用大括号{}括起来，否则只有</span><span data-lake-id="u3522c287" id="u3522c287" class="lake-fontsize-12">首句有效</span></p><p data-lake-id="u00fdbde5" id="u00fdbde5"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A0%2C%22id%22%3A%22eecXT%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="ue5887560" id="ue5887560" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc333cef9" id="uc333cef9"><span data-lake-id="uc0f0b1da" id="uc0f0b1da" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">制作一个打分系统(满分制：100)，使用if...else方法，分数需整数</span></p><p data-lake-id="uafdd13b8" id="uafdd13b8" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u8cab4010" id="u8cab4010" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">60分以下：评级为D</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue975a96f" id="ue975a96f"><span data-lake-id="ua8d38000" id="ua8d38000" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">	</span><span data-lake-id="u2025b839" id="u2025b839" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">60-80分 ： 评级为C</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4fdfbee8" id="u4fdfbee8"><span data-lake-id="u2eb884ab" id="u2eb884ab" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">	</span><span data-lake-id="u87d9ab68" id="u87d9ab68" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">80-90分 ： 评级为B</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub1a02aae" id="ub1a02aae"><span data-lake-id="u97590966" id="u97590966" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">	</span><span data-lake-id="u570f1cfd" id="u570f1cfd" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">90-100分： 评级为A</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2019e68e" id="u2019e68e"><span data-lake-id="u3172d0fe" id="u3172d0fe" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">	不在0-100范围内：错误</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="v2Jdn" id="v2Jdn"><span data-lake-id="ucaf4e380" id="ucaf4e380">2.2 switch</span></h2><p data-lake-id="07e542e2ccc12bd750dfd74f5f1114d9" id="07e542e2ccc12bd750dfd74f5f1114d9"><span data-lake-id="ue7676f4f" id="ue7676f4f" class="lake-fontsize-12">switch 语句是一种多路判定语句，它测试表达式是否与一些常量整数值中的某一个值匹 配，并执行相应的分支动作</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22switch(n)%5Cn%7B%5Cncase%201%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22one%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20break%3B%5Cn%5Cncase%202%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22two%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20break%3B%5Cn%5Cncase%203%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22three%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20break%3B%5Cn%5Cndefault%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%97%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k3piK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="u4e539022"><li fid="u7eb2ee14" data-lake-id="u0a8509fe" id="u0a8509fe"><span data-lake-id="uc556ba14" id="uc556ba14" class="lake-fontsize-12">switch(n) 语句中的 n 必须是一个整型表达式，即 switch 判断的数据必须是整型或字符</span></li><li fid="u7eb2ee14" data-lake-id="u5f2643e9" id="u5f2643e9"><span data-lake-id="u1764ec17" id="u1764ec17" class="lake-fontsize-12">case 语句只能带整型常量，包括普通整型或字符，不包括 const</span></li><li fid="u7eb2ee14" data-lake-id="u85259ac1" id="u85259ac1"><span data-lake-id="udca111a8" id="udca111a8" class="lake-fontsize-12">break 语句的作用是跳出整个 swtich 结构，没有 break 程序会略过case往下执行</span></li><li fid="u7eb2ee14" data-lake-id="u3662562a" id="u3662562a"><span data-lake-id="u8b1dcf1b" id="u8b1dcf1b" class="lake-fontsize-12">default 语句不是必须的，一般放在最后面（因此不需要 break）</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="7a8ddae3ed4a354cb9ca4998a9f8a6ac" id="7a8ddae3ed4a354cb9ca4998a9f8a6ac"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A3%2C%22id%22%3A%22OOgv9%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="ubbbf7535" id="ubbbf7535" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u06ca3256" id="u06ca3256"><span data-lake-id="u009c8fdf" id="u009c8fdf" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">小张加盟一家餐饮企业，在每个季度结束后，小张必须向总部缴纳加盟费，加盟费与营业额的提成关系如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6df7ad03" id="u6df7ad03"><span data-lake-id="u7ea879bc" id="u7ea879bc" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">		</span><span data-lake-id="u8ad9ec13" id="u8ad9ec13" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">营业额 提成系数</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9c633665" id="u9c633665"><span data-lake-id="ue85646f7" id="ue85646f7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">		</span><span data-lake-id="u7b171fd9" id="u7b171fd9" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">0&lt;=n&lt;10w 0.1</span></p><p data-lake-id="u05126a79" id="u05126a79"><span data-lake-id="u98f3986b" id="u98f3986b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">		</span><span data-lake-id="u47b539b7" id="u47b539b7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">10&lt;=n&lt;20w 0.075</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc3e3ebba" id="uc3e3ebba"><span data-lake-id="udee73640" id="udee73640" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">		</span><span data-lake-id="u71965aed" id="u71965aed" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">20&lt;=n&lt;40w 0.05</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc64ca4f0" id="uc64ca4f0"><span data-lake-id="uf1a45ff8" id="uf1a45ff8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">		</span><span data-lake-id="u34834777" id="u34834777" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">40&lt;=n&lt;60w 0.03</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2e1474f5" id="u2e1474f5"><span data-lake-id="ufd7797d0" id="ufd7797d0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">		</span><span data-lake-id="uaf00b5b6" id="uaf00b5b6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">60&lt;=n&lt;100w 0.015</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue4f3daee" id="ue4f3daee"><span data-lake-id="uec6c4bdb" id="uec6c4bdb" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">		</span><span data-lake-id="u8661ae5f" id="u8661ae5f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">n &gt;= 100w </span><span data-lake-id="ua1a9b6ad" id="ua1a9b6ad" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">			</span><span data-lake-id="u808c9454" id="u808c9454" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">0.01</span></p><p data-lake-id="u346d8a8c" id="u346d8a8c"><span data-lake-id="uc800fcb5" id="uc800fcb5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">		请输入小张的营业额，然后求出它需要的提交的加盟费</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F*%5Cn*%E8%A7%A3%E9%A2%98%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%20%20%20%201.%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8C%E8%B7%AF%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%E6%9D%A5%E6%A0%87%E8%AE%B0%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E9%A2%9D%5Cn%20%20%20%202.%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8C%E8%B7%AF%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%87%E8%AE%B0%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%A4%9A%E8%B7%AF%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%5Cn*%2F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GWMEk%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="siAg3" id="siAg3"><span data-lake-id="u0ec46b49" id="u0ec46b49">3.循环语句</span></h1><p data-lake-id="922ce2fc008218cb4b27933254622230" id="922ce2fc008218cb4b27933254622230"><span data-lake-id="uefde5378" id="uefde5378" class="lake-fontsize-12">循环 （loop ）是重复执行其他语句（循环体）的一种语句。在C语 言中，每个循环都有一个控制表达式，每次执行循环体（循环重复 一次）时都要对控制 表达式求值。如果表达式为真（即值不为零），那么继续执行循环。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="mlIB9" id="mlIB9"><span data-lake-id="u96be4687" id="u96be4687">3.1 while</span></h2><p data-lake-id="49599e6b493a6cdd2b2c141b45e06a08" id="49599e6b493a6cdd2b2c141b45e06a08"><span data-lake-id="u3f265653" id="u3f265653" class="lake-fontsize-12">while 循环：先判断，再循环</span></p><p data-lake-id="1957abeb9ed8d9b6a65e3770a819cb40" id="1957abeb9ed8d9b6a65e3770a819cb40" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560102416-124291f5-19eb-466e-ab5e-85fcbdc0ac51.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A146%2C%22originHeight%22%3A146%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JXgLz%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="aafc94e69a129787bc66499e64fd33f0" id="aafc94e69a129787bc66499e64fd33f0" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u04e2c2b5" id="u04e2c2b5" class="lake-fontsize-12">先判断，再循环</span></p><p data-lake-id="047e238eb23b170b8bb4048c4f5d6f9e" id="047e238eb23b170b8bb4048c4f5d6f9e"><span data-lake-id="u1bb7d832" id="u1bb7d832" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20i%3D1%2C%20sum%3D0%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20while(i%3C%3D100)%7B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%AD%A5%E5%B9%85%EF%BC%8C%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E8%B7%B3%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20sum%2B%3Di%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20i%2B%2B%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Csum)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%2F*%5Cn1.%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E5%88%B0%20while%20%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%20i%3D1%EF%BC%8Ci%3C%3D100%20%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E4%BC%9A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%9B%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E5%90%8E%20i%20%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E5%8F%98%E4%B8%BA%202%EF%BC%8Csum%20%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E5%8F%98%E4%B8%BA%201%E3%80%82%5Cn2.%E6%8E%A5%E4%B8%8B%E6%9D%A5%E4%BC%9A%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%20i%3C%3D100%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%20i%3D2%EF%BC%8Ci%3C%3D100%20%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%9B%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E5%90%8E%20i%20%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E5%8F%98%E4%B8%BA%203%EF%BC%8Csum%20%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E5%8F%98%E4%B8%BA3%E3%80%82%5Cn3.%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%202%5Cn4.%E5%BD%93%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%88%B0%E7%AC%AC100%E6%AC%A1%EF%BC%8Ci%20%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E5%8F%98%E4%B8%BA%20101%EF%BC%8Csum%20%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E5%8F%98%E4%B8%BA5050%EF%BC%9B%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%20i%3C%3D100%20%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E5%B0%B1%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%8C%E8%BD%AC%E8%80%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8Cwhile%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E5%90%8E%E9%9D%A2%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%5Cn*%2F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22prIu2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="4377c6d69cc36d3efae781e84cd896a0" id="4377c6d69cc36d3efae781e84cd896a0"><span data-lake-id="u379f0e79" id="u379f0e79" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果循环体内只有一条语句，那么{}可以省略</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22while(1)%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%2211%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uMGeL%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="sGDjl" id="sGDjl"><span data-lake-id="u6794ad52" id="u6794ad52">3.2 do while</span></h2><p data-lake-id="d6f3c2fd282606501b23ec78a4ac91cd" id="d6f3c2fd282606501b23ec78a4ac91cd"><span data-lake-id="ud29fe851" id="ud29fe851" class="lake-fontsize-12">do-while 循环：先循环，再判断</span></p><p data-lake-id="9b563cbdf457a3e2f9fe439d02d8b841" id="9b563cbdf457a3e2f9fe439d02d8b841" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560102681-1b62acdc-c802-46a1-8516-921c0ef268a7.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A148%2C%22originHeight%22%3A147%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f8f8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vBRHe%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="827acb74af1b91b9bc4a434b0f58168f" id="827acb74af1b91b9bc4a434b0f58168f" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9179891e" id="u9179891e" class="lake-fontsize-12">先循环，再判断</span></p><p data-lake-id="aa474efd36930d8d6c98f83cce978ccb" id="aa474efd36930d8d6c98f83cce978ccb"><span data-lake-id="u062cd3d0" id="u062cd3d0" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20i%3D1%2C%20sum%3D0%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20do%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20sum%2B%3Di%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20i%2B%2B%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7Dwhile(i%3C%3D100)%3B%20%2F%2F%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8Fwhile(i%3C%3D100)%3B%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E5%8F%B7%3B%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E8%A6%81%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20sum)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cVOK5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="u28c2a591"><li fid="u81feb859" data-lake-id="u77e723ad" id="u77e723ad" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ucaa0afe3" id="ucaa0afe3" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">while 循环先进行判断，条件为真后才执行循环体，因此循环体可能一遍也不执行。</span></li><li fid="u81feb859" data-lake-id="u77c0284a" id="u77c0284a" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u88e4b7c5" id="u88e4b7c5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">do-while 循环先执行循环体，再进行判断，因此循环体至少会执行一遍。</span></li><li fid="u81feb859" data-lake-id="u4bf7c67c" id="u4bf7c67c" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u0b65c77e" id="u0b65c77e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">do-while 循环中的 while 语句后面有分号；</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uecbcacb1" id="uecbcacb1"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u7bc85fef" id="u7bc85fef"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A4%2C%22id%22%3A%22xWCIK%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u073ab0e0" id="u073ab0e0" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue10ce663" id="ue10ce663"><span data-lake-id="u72d31dde" id="u72d31dde" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">使用while 系列语句循环计算1...100的偶数的和</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wHPVK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="qqr0y" id="qqr0y"><span data-lake-id="u396aa9e5" id="u396aa9e5">3.3 for</span></h2><p data-lake-id="8ec6882ec4c794981f69802e887e5990" id="8ec6882ec4c794981f69802e887e5990"><span data-lake-id="uc47550af" id="uc47550af" class="lake-fontsize-12">上述例子中，步幅和判断条件，步进长度都被放到了</span><span data-lake-id="ucca9f9dc" id="ucca9f9dc" class="lake-fontsize-12">不同的地方</span><span data-lake-id="ub112d1be" id="ub112d1be" class="lake-fontsize-12">，代码结构较为松散。为了让程序更加紧凑，可以使用 for 循环来代替</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22for(%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F1%3B%20%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F2%3B%20%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F3)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%E5%9D%97%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lHonD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="dcc2550753cf8d04779350d1f5d09fa6" id="dcc2550753cf8d04779350d1f5d09fa6"><span data-lake-id="uc357d2cf" id="uc357d2cf" class="lake-fontsize-12">“表达式1”仅在第一次循环时执行，以后都不会再执行，可以认为这是一个</span><span data-lake-id="u842a9880" id="u842a9880" class="lake-fontsize-12">初始化语句</span><span data-lake-id="u27b6e7c5" id="u27b6e7c5" class="lake-fontsize-12">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="a3a32a762e7a84e159756e1ab46f3064" id="a3a32a762e7a84e159756e1ab46f3064"><span data-lake-id="uc988caee" id="uc988caee" class="lake-fontsize-12">“表达式2”一般是一个关系表达式，决定了是否还要继续下次循环，称为“循环条件”</span></p><p data-lake-id="c15893525015476b01d23f2820b1d4c6" id="c15893525015476b01d23f2820b1d4c6"><span data-lake-id="uaae7edfb" id="uaae7edfb" class="lake-fontsize-12">“表达式3”很多情况下是一个带有自增或自减操作的表达式，以使循环条件逐渐变得“不成立”</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20i%2C%20sum%3D0%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20for(i%3D1%2F*%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%E2%91%A0*%2F%3B%20i%3C%3D100%2F*%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%E2%91%A1*%2F%3B%20i%2B%2B%2F*%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%E2%91%A2*%2F)%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20sum%2B%3Di%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Csum)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%2F*%5Cn1.%E5%85%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E2%80%9C%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F1%E2%80%9D(i%3D1)%5Cn2.%E5%86%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E2%80%9C%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F2%E2%80%9D(i%3C%3D100)%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E5%AE%83%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%EF%BC%88%E9%9D%9E0%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E3%80%82%5Cn3.%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%8C%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E4%BD%93%E5%90%8E%E5%86%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E2%80%9C%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F3%E2%80%9D(i%2B%2B)%5Cn4.%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A42%E5%92%8C3%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E5%88%B0%E2%80%9C%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F2%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E4%B8%BA%E5%81%87%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%5Cn*%2F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xNYTX%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="c86f36e624f5b4cf8a052bac7b52b03b" id="c86f36e624f5b4cf8a052bac7b52b03b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560102906-a2bfdd66-9721-4113-b180-d7e4c7d63944.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A545%2C%22height%22%3A332%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A825%2C%22originHeight%22%3A502%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f4f4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Lg0f7%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="d2d674574f8934e3ef1db14d86761b5d" id="d2d674574f8934e3ef1db14d86761b5d"><span data-lake-id="u953b4ff4" id="u953b4ff4" class="lake-fontsize-12">for 循环中的“表达式1（初始化条件）”、“表达式2(循环条件)”和“表达式3（自增或自减）”都是可选项，都可以省略（但分号;必须保留）</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20i%20%3D%201%2C%20sum%20%3D%200%3B%5Cnfor(%20%3B%20i%3C%3D100%3B%20i%2B%2B)%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20sum%2B%3Di%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%2F%2F%E5%B0%86i%3D1%E7%A7%BB%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%86%20for%20%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%96%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PvLTT%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22for(i%3D1%3B%20%3B%20i%2B%2B)%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20sum%3Dsum%2Bi%3B%2F%2F%E7%9C%81%E7%95%A5%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9C%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F2(%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6)%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%8D%E5%81%9A%E5%85%B6%E5%AE%83%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E5%B0%B1%E4%BC%9A%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E6%AD%BB%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N0U8S%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="910f65c015df56f5007ae4146b1f9b6e" id="910f65c015df56f5007ae4146b1f9b6e"><span data-lake-id="ua17912fd" id="ua17912fd" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22for(%20i%3D1%3B%20i%3C%3D100%3B%20)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20sum%3Dsum%2Bi%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20i%2B%2B%3B%5Cn%7D%20%5Cn%2F%2F%E7%9C%81%E7%95%A5%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9C%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F3(%E8%87%AA%E5%A2%9E%E6%88%96%E8%87%AA%E5%87%8F)%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E2%80%9C%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F2(%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6)%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E6%97%B6%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uVv9Y%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="uf3059cd2"><li fid="u5deb805e" data-lake-id="uec9f1770" id="uec9f1770" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u45ce4841" id="u45ce4841" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">循环的标准语法是： for(表达式1 ; 表达式2 ; 表达式3）</span></li><li fid="u5deb805e" data-lake-id="udf00182a" id="udf00182a" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u2122e222" id="u2122e222" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">表达式1一般用来初始化循环控制变量</span></li><li fid="u5deb805e" data-lake-id="u35a61264" id="u35a61264" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u5c623faf" id="u5c623faf" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">表达式2一般用来作为循环判定条件，为真则进入循环，为假则跳出循环</span></li><li fid="u5deb805e" data-lake-id="u7cb33f73" id="u7cb33f73" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u21d6be3c" id="u21d6be3c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">表达式3一般用来更新循环控制变量</span></li><li fid="u5deb805e" data-lake-id="u91d4624d" id="u91d4624d" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uceb7c3a3" id="uceb7c3a3" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">三个表达式均可以省略，但分号不能省略</span></li><li fid="u5deb805e" data-lake-id="u8c157940" id="u8c157940" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ub5539bf9" id="ub5539bf9" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">while注重循环条件，for注重循环次数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="723bc225769704a2ec2fa6c44bade2cd" id="723bc225769704a2ec2fa6c44bade2cd"><span data-lake-id="ubbf60002" id="ubbf60002" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h1 data-lake-id="tfSSP" id="tfSSP"><span data-lake-id="u85e9cef0" id="u85e9cef0">4.跳转语句</span></h1><p data-lake-id="7ac355bb7bdfd06e5a1fbc762d18be59" id="7ac355bb7bdfd06e5a1fbc762d18be59"><span data-lake-id="u0cb901a8" id="u0cb901a8" class="lake-fontsize-12">使用while或for循环时，如果想提前结束循环（在不满足结束条件的情况下结束循环），可以使用break或continue关键字</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="Q2jfz" id="Q2jfz"><span data-lake-id="u3759f69e" id="u3759f69e">4.1 break</span></h2><p data-lake-id="034563dd4c4e1ff41d58f50f0d82b787" id="034563dd4c4e1ff41d58f50f0d82b787"><span data-lake-id="u02b7c60a" id="u02b7c60a" class="lake-fontsize-12">当 break 关键字用于 while、for 循环时，会终止循环而执行整个循环语句后面的代码。break 关键字通常和 if 语句一起使用，即满足条件时便跳出循环</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20i%3D1%2C%20sum%3D0%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20while(1)%7B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%BA%E6%AD%BB%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20sum%2B%3Di%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20i%2B%2B%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if(i%3E100)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20break%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20sum)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kMmtb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="3a3a3ed44732212840a6c29bca32be02" id="3a3a3ed44732212840a6c29bca32be02"><span data-lake-id="u50b252bb" id="u50b252bb" class="lake-fontsize-12">在多层循环中，一个 break 语句只向外</span><span data-lake-id="u03a9a1e7" id="u03a9a1e7" class="lake-fontsize-12">跳一层</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="Xep10" id="Xep10"><span data-lake-id="u6dee52ea" id="u6dee52ea">4.1 continue</span></h2><p data-lake-id="3e74cdbd3585866ef69ac56de6dfa5e0" id="3e74cdbd3585866ef69ac56de6dfa5e0"><span data-lake-id="u4c34c542" id="u4c34c542" class="lake-fontsize-12">continue 语句的作用是跳过循环体中剩余的语句而强制进入下一次循环。continue语句只用在 while、for 循环中，常与 if 条件语句一起使用，判断条件是否成立</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20for(int%20i%3D1%3B%20i%3C%3D100%3B%20i%2B%2B)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(i%257%20%3D%3D%200)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20continue%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E8%B7%B3%E8%BF%87%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%83%BD%E8%A2%AB7%E6%95%B4%E9%99%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20i)%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e98e7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="cf1eb183f522c68740b5d61c2736df44" id="cf1eb183f522c68740b5d61c2736df44"><u><span data-lake-id="u087805cf" id="u087805cf" class="lake-fontsize-12">break与continue的对比</span></u><span data-lake-id="u8d80cf4b" id="u8d80cf4b" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><ul list="ud7a6700d"><li fid="uc27231f0" data-lake-id="udcab74cd" id="udcab74cd"><span data-lake-id="udaef1a51" id="udaef1a51" class="lake-fontsize-12">break 用来结束一层中所有循环，循环语句不再有执行的机会；</span></li><li fid="uc27231f0" data-lake-id="uf7289dc8" id="uf7289dc8"><span data-lake-id="u04c3bbf5" id="u04c3bbf5" class="lake-fontsize-12">continue 用来结束本次循环，直接跳到下一次循环，如果循环条件成立，还会继续循环。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4e7dcb7a" id="u4e7dcb7a"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u07a4161a" id="u07a4161a"><span data-lake-id="u8c32750d" id="u8c32750d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">运用场景与特点</span></p><ul list="ud7a6700d" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u4383fece" data-lake-id="u50dc5b84" id="u50dc5b84"><span data-lake-id="u8496aa95" id="u8496aa95" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">break关键字只能用于循环（while for do...while）和switch语句中，表示结束循环或者跳出switch语句</span></li><li fid="u4383fece" data-lake-id="ub5d4a929" id="ub5d4a929"><span data-lake-id="ud69282ca" id="ud69282ca" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">break关键字只能跳出最近一层的循环，也就是说，如果有多重循环，只能跳出最靠近break语句那层循环 </span></li><li fid="u4383fece" data-lake-id="u5ebcfbb9" id="u5ebcfbb9"><span data-lake-id="uc07d6c30" id="uc07d6c30" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">break关键字 不能 单独用于 if语句中，除非if语句外面包含了循环</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue58d4289" id="ue58d4289"><span data-lake-id="u72a16e0e" id="u72a16e0e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">逻辑：</span></p><ul list="ud7a6700d" start="4" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u4383fece" data-lake-id="u8b736c5c" id="u8b736c5c"><span data-lake-id="u76d93f41" id="u76d93f41" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">continue关键字只能用于循环体中（while do...while for），用于提前结束当前循环体后，又从最近一层循环体开始执行</span></li><li fid="u4383fece" data-lake-id="u22f205f8" id="u22f205f8"><span data-lake-id="u6a20b3f7" id="u6a20b3f7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">continue关键字不能 单独用于 if语句或者switch 语句中，除非外面包含了循环</span></li><li fid="u4383fece" data-lake-id="u8b1e54db" id="u8b1e54db"><span data-lake-id="u0d42c951" id="u0d42c951" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">break：① 跳出 switch 语句； ② 跳出当层循环体while(1）{while(1){break;}}</span></li><li fid="u4383fece" data-lake-id="uda94fce7" id="uda94fce7"><span data-lake-id="u8d89bae5" id="u8d89bae5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">continue：结束当次循环，进入下次循环</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="WGyK8" id="WGyK8"><span data-lake-id="ueacaf71a" id="ueacaf71a">4.1 goto</span></h2><p data-lake-id="0bc705285c166420b41e372a98e44af5" id="0bc705285c166420b41e372a98e44af5"><span data-lake-id="u7b7ed33d" id="u7b7ed33d" class="lake-fontsize-12">goto语句直接跳转到本代码块中的标签处</span></p><p data-lake-id="6bdf49a266d5aaa56a8eb925acdf2614" id="6bdf49a266d5aaa56a8eb925acdf2614"><span data-lake-id="uc8da990f" id="uc8da990f" class="lake-fontsize-12">标签指的是以冒号结尾的标识符</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20__LINE__)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E7%AC%AC3%E8%A1%8C%20%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E8%B7%B3%E8%BD%AC%E5%88%B0label%E5%A4%84%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20goto%20label%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20__LINE__)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E7%AC%AC7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84%E8%A2%AB%E7%95%A5%E8%BF%87%5Cnlabel%3A%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20__LINE__)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E7%AC%AC9%E8%A1%8C%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FtCUz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="338ecce9ae8aea304bd96320365cb14d" id="338ecce9ae8aea304bd96320365cb14d"><span data-lake-id="ud2af8833" id="ud2af8833" class="lake-fontsize-12">goto语句常被用在程序的错误处理中</span></p><p data-lake-id="bdc67b8bac14a70210a8c261b3c98dda" id="bdc67b8bac14a70210a8c261b3c98dda"><span data-lake-id="uec7fe54e" id="uec7fe54e" class="lake-fontsize-12">goto语句的无条件跳转不利于程序的可读性，一般不建议使用</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="mmrXV" id="mmrXV"><span data-lake-id="uaf73325c" id="uaf73325c">5.循环嵌套</span></h1><p data-lake-id="a0fdf4d4c4248d5bf71be13874a6eab3" id="a0fdf4d4c4248d5bf71be13874a6eab3"><span data-lake-id="u82bdf709" id="u82bdf709" class="lake-fontsize-12">在C语言中，if-else、while、do-while、for 都可以相互嵌套。所谓嵌套，就是一条语句里面还有另一条语句，例如 for 里面还有 for，while 里面还有 while，或者 for 里面有 while，while 里面有 if-else，这都是允许的</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20i%2C%20j%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20for(i%3D1%3B%20i%3C%3D4%3B%20i%2B%2B)%7B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%A4%96%E5%B1%82for%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20for(j%3D1%3B%20j%3C%3D4%3B%20j%2B%2B)%7B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%86%85%E5%B1%82for%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22i%3D%25d%2C%20j%3D%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20i%2C%20j)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%2F%2F%E6%9C%AC%E4%BE%8B%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E7%9A%84%20for%20%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E5%B5%8C%E5%A5%97%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%96%E5%B1%82%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E5%92%8C%E5%86%85%E5%B1%82%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E4%BA%A4%E5%8F%89%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%96%E5%B1%82%20for%20%E6%AF%8F%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%86%85%E5%B1%82%20for%20%E5%B0%B1%E8%A6%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%9B%9B%E6%AC%A1%E3%80%82%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZzTfA%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="ud3ec949c" id="ud3ec949c"><br></p><p data-lake-id="uc5d5ebc2" id="uc5d5ebc2"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22K34rB%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u18346626" id="u18346626" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue8568692" id="ue8568692"><strong><span data-lake-id="u02a076ff" id="u02a076ff" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">const</span></strong></p><ul list="u59a8a6ba"><li fid="u3be1d4e2" data-lake-id="ue85a355f" id="ue85a355f"><span data-lake-id="ueaec6e11" id="ueaec6e11" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">逻辑：使一个变量不可修饰</span></li><li fid="u3be1d4e2" data-lake-id="u92fdecf9" id="u92fdecf9"><span data-lake-id="u346dee2f" id="u346dee2f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">作用：</span></li></ul><ul list="u59a8a6ba" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u7821a7d3" data-lake-id="u0e1200d2" id="u0e1200d2"><span data-lake-id="u1cd681d4" id="u1cd681d4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">修饰普通变量，使之不可修改</span></li><li fid="u7821a7d3" data-lake-id="udd29507a" id="udd29507a"><span data-lake-id="u7a6e8baa" id="u7a6e8baa" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">修饰指针变量，使之不可修改或者使其指向的目标不可修改</span></li></ul><ul list="u59a8a6ba" start="3"><li fid="u3be1d4e2" data-lake-id="ud263e786" id="ud263e786"><span data-lake-id="u5d4ffb16" id="u5d4ffb16" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">示例：</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20const%20a%20%3D%20100%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8Fa%5Cnconst%20int%20b%20%3D%20200%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8Fb%5Cn%5Cna%20%3D%20101%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%5Cnb%20%3D%20202%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e1rHZ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u850c2db7" id="u850c2db7"><br></p>